1509577.description:
Original ID: 18
Original Title: Verify in static LAG the ports will bond together as long as their keys match
Original Description: Link Partner cannot be discovered for Static link aggregation. &#160;In this case, ports aggregate based on keys alone.&#160;

1533515.steps:
1. Configure two L2 LAG groups via GUI switching page, one is in Portshield mode, another is in Trunk mode, both are in WAN mode, make sure they have WAN IP which are accessible.
2. Enable the management option ping/https/http in their LAG interface. (For trunk mode it should be the aggregator port's VLAN interface).&#160;
3. From a WAN PC try to manage DUT through the LAG interface IP, verify ping/https/http method.
4. Shutdown the aggregator ports in both LAG group, verify the&#160;ping/https/http management traffic again. 5. No shutdown the&#160;aggregator ports in step 4, shutdown the LAG member ports in both LAG group,&#160;verify the&#160;
ping/https/http management traffic again.

